{"identity_key": "bilibili:1195190558458380313", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1195190558458380313", "content": "一定，会坠入一场真心的恋爱——\n\n【恋爱与选举与巧克力】收藏集正式开启预约～\n\n那些熟悉的身影、怦然心动的瞬间，以及闪闪发亮的青春回忆，\n都将在这次收藏集中，再次与你相遇。\n\n把那份心动与喜欢，再一次珍藏起来吧。\n传送门：https://www.bilibili.com/h5/mall/digital-card/home?-Abrowser=live&act_id=112624&hybrid_set_header=2&lottery_id=112625&f_source=social&from=official\n\n预约时间：4月25日 18:00\n正式开售：4月26日 18:00", "publisher": "sprite公式", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1195190558458380313", "published_at": "2026-04-25T11:09:47+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-13T15:27:25.426351+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/376463fc28f0cfec290c200f2d2e65653706923618666922.jpg"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_3706923618666922", "uid": "3706923618666922", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 117, "retweets": 0, "replies": 35}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
{"identity_key": "bilibili:1195209078352117760", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1195209078352117760", "content": "葵妈忽然有感而发，发了篇推特，简单介绍了下她的家庭情况，翻译了下，内容如下。\n\n我从记事之前，父亲就已经离婚了，所以我一直没有母亲。但就在我快要上小学的时候，父亲却说要搬离原来住的房子，去别的地方生活。于是，我突然就有了一个陌生的新妈妈和一个妹妹。\n因为我是独生子，所以作为孩子，有个妹妹其实挺开心的，有了妈妈也很高兴。我和妹妹每天都玩得很好，但问题出在新妈妈身上……\n我爸爸工作到晚上才回来，那时我试着叫她“妈妈”，她根本不搭理我。洗澡的时候，她和妹妹一起洗，会帮妹妹擦身子、吹头发，笑眯眯的。但对我呢，洗完澡就不管了，不理我，就让我湿淋淋地晾着，什么都不帮我做。动不动还会扇我耳光，每天都是这样。\n这样的日子持续了一阵子，后来爸爸发现了这些事。我记得他和那个女人吵过架，说她是不是只疼爱自己亲生的孩子。\n最后，这种生活过了几个月就结束了，她回到了自己的娘家。从那以后，父亲再也没有再婚过……\n所以我觉得，带着孩子再婚的问题，不光是男性一方的问题，女性这边也存在很多问题。\n无论是男是女，如果要带着孩子再婚，却不能从心底里去爱对方的孩子的话，我真的希望他们绝对不要选择再婚。\n……这就是我作为一个曾经有过这种悲伤经历的孩子的一点题外话。", "publisher": "KIDFansClub", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1195209078352117760", "published_at": "2026-04-25T12:21:39+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-13T15:27:25.426351+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/9dfad8de91611129b69a8181d2c92b7e2805329.png"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_2805329", "uid": "2805329", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 106, "retweets": 0, "replies": 4}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
{"identity_key": "bilibili:1195211388998385665", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1195211388998385665", "content": "日本的众筹平台「うぶごえ」（Ubgoe）疑似卷款跑路的影响也波及到了Navel之前的一款作品《けれど輝く夜空のような 》上，西又葵和Navel发布了一个紧急声明，表示该游戏的开发和众筹反馈并未收到影响，请玩家放心。由于Ubgoe平台已经无法登录，所以需要玩家自行联系Navel获取最新进展。", "publisher": "KIDFansClub", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1195211388998385665", "published_at": "2026-04-25T12:30:37+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-13T15:27:25.426351+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/b00850a7b1a5a2f48b5936ab464edf772805329.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/d3a303e1cf64c4850eb149702ba94a712805329.jpg"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_2805329", "uid": "2805329", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 65, "retweets": 0, "replies": 0}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
{"identity_key": "bilibili:1195213897291792389", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1195213897291792389", "content": "《告别回忆：双想FD》steam版发售\n之前延期的《告别回忆 双想 Break out of my shell》steam版已于4月24日正式在steam平台发售，游戏语言为简体、繁体中文、日文。新作打九折，售价为普通版198元，豪华版297元。", "publisher": "KIDFansClub", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1195213897291792389", "published_at": "2026-04-25T12:40:21+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-13T15:27:25.426351+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/9cc82e64e7674e390d15b353a0bb38302805329.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/8d4ce374bbd26f98ab65730182639db02805329.png"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_2805329", "uid": "2805329", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "《告别回忆：双想FD》steam版发售", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 49, "retweets": 0, "replies": 2}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
